<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>I am certain I told you at the very beginning, did I not?
{PAUSE ""}
　That <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama is not required to know the truth.<PG>
Therefore, whoever appears and whatever you hear, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama, please follow the story just as I guide you.<PG>
<VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama has no need to know anything superfluous.<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
